### Unauth smoke (should be 401/403)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/shifts

###
GET http://localhost:3000/api/settings

###
GET http://localhost:3000/api/reports/kpi

### Notes
# For authenticated API calls, use browser session cookies.
# Easiest: open DevTools -> Application -> Cookies -> copy `next-auth.session-token` (or similar)
# and add it to `Cookie:` header in requests below.

